2. HOW WE USE INFORMATION
We use information to provide, maintain, personalize, protect, and improve the Service. This includes using information to:
create, authenticate, and manage accounts;
deliver music, videos, playlists, recommendations, search results, events, subscriptions, ads, uploads, artist tools, and similar features;
process payments, subscriptions, tickets, invoices, offers, refunds, and related customer support;
review, moderate, format, publish, reject, remove, or troubleshoot content, submissions, ads, and user activity;
send service messages, account notices, receipts, security alerts, support responses, marketing messages, and push or email notifications;
understand audience activity, improve content discovery, measure performance, build reports, and analyze how the Service is used;
personalize content, ads, promotions, recommendations, and user experience;
detect, prevent, and respond to fraud, abuse, spam, security issues, rights violations, technical problems, and policy violations;
comply with law, enforce our terms, protect users, protect RJ, and exercise or defend legal rights.
